write-relation-transitive\">56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.5.44(iii)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"251"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>272</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0d1c099bf76b43d1\" href=\"?note=0d1c099bf76b43d1\" title=\"56-df-dependency-pair\">56-df-dependency-pair</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,V,R,\\Sigma^\\#\">\\(\\Sigma,V,R,\\Sigma^\\#\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^\\#=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma^\\#,V)\">\\(T^\\#=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma^\\#,V)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma^\\#,V,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma^\\#,V,R)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d7d212169855cb94\" href=\"?note=d7d212169855cb94\" title=\"56-df-signature-relative-rewrite\">56-df-signature-relative-rewrite</a> 的显式签名接口；下式定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^\\#\">\\(\\to_R^\\#\\)</span>。关系的星闭包取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a> 在载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^\\#\">\\(T^\\#\\)</span> 上的构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{DP}(\\Sigma,V,R)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{DP}(\\Sigma,V,R)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_i=(s_i,t_i)\">\\(D_i=(s_i,t_i)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^\\#\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma^\\#,V,R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_R^\\#\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma^\\#,V,R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{InfiniteChain}(\\Sigma,V,R,D)&amp;\\iff\n\\exists(\\sigma_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma^\\#,V)^{\\mathbb N}\n\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nt_i\\sigma_i\\;(\\to_R^\\#)^*\\;s_{i+1}\\sigma_{i+1},\\\\\n\\mathrm{HasInfiniteChain}(\\Sigma,V,R)&amp;\\iff\n\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{DP}(\\Sigma,V,R)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\mathrm{InfiniteChain}(\\Sigma,V,R,D).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{InfiniteChain}(\\Sigma,V,R,D)&amp;\\iff\n\\exists(\\sigma_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma^\\#,V)^{\\mathbb N}\n\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nt_i\\sigma_i\\;(\\to_R^\\#)^*\\;s_{i+1}\\sigma_{i+1},\\\\\n\\mathrm{HasInfiniteChain}(\\Sigma,V,R)&amp;\\iff\n\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{DP}(\\Sigma,V,R)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\mathrm{InfiniteChain}(\\Sigma,V,R,D).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definition 6.5.44(iii)。相邻依赖对可用不同替换，而同一对的左端和右端必须使用同一个 σ_i；此跨边一致性不能被逐边可达性或图上存在环取代。零步连接允许；例如依赖对的两端相等也会产生链。扩充签名上的替换可含新符号；若要只使用原签名替换，存在无限链的判据等价，可把新符号投影回原符号。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.5.44(iii)，印刷页 251。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-dependency-pair","status":"resolved","id":"0d1c099bf76b43d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-dependency-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-signature-relative-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"d7d212169855cb94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · 